<title>HUNGARY: BUDAPEST BOURSE DELISTS HAJDUTEJ ON MAY 20.</title>
<headline>BUDAPEST BOURSE DELISTS HAJDUTEJ ON MAY 20.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) will delist the stocks of dairy company Hajdutej Rt on May 20, the BSE said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Hajdutej's shareholders approved the delisting at an extraordinary general meeting in late March.</p>
<p>Netherland's Nutricia -- Hajdutej's majority owner -- announced a buyout offer for all Hajdutej shares for a period between February 28 and April 14 at a price of 1,500 forints a share.</p>
<p>The bourse's statement said 26,120 stocks were sold to Nutricia during the buyout period.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
